WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.925
Step five checks the stage's evidence
against the requirement rows.

2
00:00:03.925 --> 00:00:07.748
Only two of seventeen are
evidenced, both pre-flight rows,

3
00:00:07.748 --> 00:00:10.188
so the check fails with exit code two.

4
00:00:10.188 --> 00:00:11.626
Why are the others missing?

5
00:00:11.626 --> 00:00:13.706
A rollback add entry is recorded:

6
00:00:13.706 --> 00:00:17.638
it proves the change was written
down, not that the step worked.

7
00:00:17.638 --> 00:00:20.474
And the smoke record is
a failing fixture run.

8
00:00:20.474 --> 00:00:25.150
Then sha two fifty-six sum confirms
every evidence record reads OK.

9
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.837
Step six asks production's
pre-flight check

10
00:00:27.837 --> 00:00:30.300
to promote on that report and that check.

11
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.137
P F oh nine passes.

12
00:00:32.137 --> 00:00:36.259
P F ten fails: the hashes aren't
the ones in the promotion record,

13
00:00:36.259 --> 00:00:39.411
the smoke report failed
and ran in fixture mode,

14
00:00:39.411 --> 00:00:43.775
and promotion needs a live test
run; the evidence check failed too.

15
00:00:43.775 --> 00:00:48.625
A fixture report, or a stage with
unevidenced rows, can never promote.

16
00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:53.350
Step seven runs the tests, forty-six
pass, and step eight cleans up.
